1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
I only want to know one thing:

2
00:00:01,630 --> 00:00:02,520
is he safe?

3
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:03,840
I don't know where he is either.

4
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,520
You don't know where he is?

5
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,520
Where am I?

6
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:07,400
My place.

7
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,750
Now you can finally stay by my side.

8
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:09,840
Stay by your side?

9
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:10,630
Sir.

10
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:10,910
Yes?

11
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:12,910
Two pineapple buns with butter.

12
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:17,040
One satay beef noodles from the Afternoon Tea section.

13
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:20,590
And one BBQ pork spaghetti in soup.

14
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:21,950
I need to use the restroom.

15
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,680
You keep watching. I'll be right back.

16
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:27,940
Foon Gor, where are you going?

17
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:30,590
So you never intended to be with me, did you?

18
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:32,630
It's not too late to turn back now.

19
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:34,680
The police will find you soon.

20
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:35,680
You won't get away.

21
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:36,630
Hey, what are you doing?

22
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:38,630
Shawn, it's still not too late to turn back!

23
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,110
What's so special about this bin?

24
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:42,950
Sir,

25
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:44,310
have you seen this man?

26
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:45,360
He's a regular.

27
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,310
All these years,

28
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:48,430
he's always ordered milk tea, fish balls, and buttered pineapple buns.

29
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:52,310
That day, he switched to satay beef noodles and BBQ pork spaghetti in soup.

30
00:00:52,310 --> 00:00:54,380
[You're Nothing]

31
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:31,340
♪With you, it's like I can breathe again♪

32
00:01:31,770 --> 00:01:34,540
♪I can't live without this breath, this heartbeat♪

33
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:37,450
♪Forever's too far, but you're right here♪

34
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:39,880
♪Together we'll take on this jaded world♪

35
00:01:40,020 --> 00:01:42,860
♪With you, I'll cross the dark, outrun the pain, and run away♪

36
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:47,020
♪Still believing in true love, no matter how naive, calling you♪

37
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:51,810
♪I'm willing to wait♪

38
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:55,500
♪I love you like you're a part of me♪

39
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:58,300
♪I want to share my life with you♪

40
00:01:58,940 --> 00:02:04,720
♪To love this deeply, I'll give a little more♪

41
00:02:05,070 --> 00:02:06,870
♪In this cold and gray city♪

42
00:02:06,950 --> 00:02:08,580
♪Through all the pain, I'll hold you. Is it true?♪

43
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:11,030
♪Pieces of our memories slowly fade♪

44
00:02:11,110 --> 00:02:11,690
♪Stay with me♪

45
00:02:11,830 --> 00:02:14,440
♪Do you remember the day we crossed paths?♪

46
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,220
♪Stay with me♪

47
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:18,140
♪Do you remember the forever we promised?♪

48
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:20,640
♪Who's waiting for you to save them?♪

49
00:02:21,170 --> 00:02:23,680
♪My heart aches, breaks, and struggles on♪

50
00:02:24,210 --> 00:02:26,720
♪How can I hold on to everything in one moment?♪

51
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:30,940
♪Stop blaming fate and learn to let it be♪

52
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:34,820
[Ash]
[Episode 9]

53
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:17,310
Boss.

54
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,200
Shh.

55
00:03:26,270 --> 00:03:28,110
All communication devices and sharp objects in the house

56
00:03:28,310 --> 00:03:29,720
have been removed as you instructed.

57
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,310
We've also increased patrols around the property.

58
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:32,680
Good.

59
00:03:33,270 --> 00:03:35,200
Let me know the moment there's any news.

60
00:03:35,790 --> 00:03:36,590
No problem.

61
00:03:56,430 --> 00:03:58,360
Siu Yan hasn't been back to Feros these past few days.

62
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:00,470
We've followed the people around him,

63
00:04:00,750 --> 00:04:02,040
but none of them has done anything unusual.

64
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:05,470
It looks like he's deliberately hiding Mr. Mok.

65
00:04:09,110 --> 00:04:10,750
What about the cinema CCTV footage?

66
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:15,470
We're reconstructing the route they took that day.

67
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,680
We're only about 30% done.

68
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:20,080
There's a huge amount of footage,

69
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:21,470
so it'll take time to sort through.

70
00:04:22,150 --> 00:04:23,880
Every extra day Fei Foon spends with him

71
00:04:24,110 --> 00:04:25,470
puts him in greater danger.

72
00:04:26,470 --> 00:04:28,110
If he refuses to show himself,

73
00:04:28,270 --> 00:04:29,560
we'll have to force him out.

74
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:33,040
But we have no idea how powerful Dreamweaver is.

75
00:04:33,470 --> 00:04:35,270
If they're backing Feros,

76
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:38,910
a direct clash could leave both sides badly hurt.

77
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,560
As long as I win,

78
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,470
I don't care what it costs.

79
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:47,270
You may not care, but other people do.

80
00:04:48,470 --> 00:04:49,150
Luk King,

81
00:04:49,270 --> 00:04:50,270
what are you doing here?

82
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:51,750
I'm here to help.

83
00:04:52,470 --> 00:04:54,790
How many times have I told you? Stay out of Sheng Tung's affairs.

84
00:04:54,790 --> 00:04:55,840
Do you understand?

85
00:04:56,110 --> 00:04:56,880
I do.

86
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,720
That's why I have no interest in Sheng Tung

87
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,240
and don't know much about how it operates.

88
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:02,880
But when it comes to legitimate business competition,

89
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:04,750
I'm no worse than you, Loek To.

90
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:09,680
I've been studying Feros for a long time.

91
00:05:09,750 --> 00:05:11,680
Their main business is real estate,

92
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:13,680
yet they keep investing in port projects.

93
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,840
At first, I couldn't understand why.

94
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,750
But then I found out

95
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:18,880
they've been buying these materials.

96
00:05:22,310 --> 00:05:23,520
Specialised cotton paper,

97
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:25,560
paper mulberry bark,

98
00:05:26,470 --> 00:05:27,560
and magnetic ink?

99
00:05:29,150 --> 00:05:31,840
They're all raw materials used to make counterfeit money.

100
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,750
If we want to force Feros into the open,

101
00:05:34,430 --> 00:05:36,270
we need to cut off their raw material supply.

102
00:05:36,430 --> 00:05:37,680
Once we've cut off their lifeline,

103
00:05:37,950 --> 00:05:39,360
Siu Yan will be forced to show himself.

104
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:42,750
Ley Tung from Australia and Hon Ko from Germany

105
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:45,430
are the two suppliers Feros deals with most often.

106
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:49,040
Their parent companies are both listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange.

107
00:05:49,150 --> 00:05:50,470
Their shareholdings are widely dispersed,

108
00:05:50,750 --> 00:05:52,040
which makes them suitable takeover targets.

109
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:52,630
Good.

110
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:55,270
I'll put Tin Ping's capital pool in your hands.

111
00:05:55,430 --> 00:05:56,720
Whatever the price,

112
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:58,240
make sure we secure controlling stakes in both companies.

113
00:05:59,430 --> 00:06:01,680
Actually, I've already taken care of those two.

114
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:05,430
There's only one parent company supplying specialised cotton paper

115
00:06:05,750 --> 00:06:07,400
that Feros still has firmly under its control.

116
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,680
What percentage do they own?

117
00:06:10,630 --> 00:06:11,680
Forty-nine per cent.

118
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:12,870
We don't have enough cash flow

119
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:14,160
to acquire it.

120
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,480
Luk King,

121
00:06:34,270 --> 00:06:35,720
I'll allocate more funds to you.

122
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:38,830
There's another way

123
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,830
to force Siu Yan to show himself.

124
00:06:41,550 --> 00:06:42,480
What way?

125
00:06:44,230 --> 00:06:45,230
Buy Feros.

126
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:47,680
You want to go that far?

127
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,830
Where are you going to get the money?

128
00:06:52,270 --> 00:06:54,080
Make them an offer they can't ignore.

129
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:01,440
That would leave you with no way back.

130
00:07:03,870 --> 00:07:05,630
I never planned on leaving myself one.

131
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,270
Luk King,

132
00:07:10,910 --> 00:07:12,400
you need to move fast.

133
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:14,510
Don't give Feros any chance to respond or fight back.

134
00:07:14,510 --> 00:07:15,310
Understood?

135
00:07:42,550 --> 00:07:43,270
Foon Gor,

136
00:07:43,550 --> 00:07:44,480
you're awake.

137
00:07:45,230 --> 00:07:46,160
How do you feel?

138
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:47,480
I'm okay.

139
00:07:47,830 --> 00:07:48,680
That's good.

140
00:07:49,910 --> 00:07:51,120
Are you hungry?

141
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:53,720
Let's go downstairs for breakfast.

142
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:55,270
I've prepared plenty of food.

143
00:07:56,550 --> 00:07:57,360
Sure.

144
00:08:12,950 --> 00:08:13,630
Foon Gor,

145
00:08:13,910 --> 00:08:15,720
do you want fried eggs or scrambled eggs?

146
00:08:16,310 --> 00:08:17,270
Either is fine.

147
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:18,590
Okay.

148
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:19,680
Have a seat first.

149
00:08:20,190 --> 00:08:21,080
It'll be ready soon.

150
00:08:35,190 --> 00:08:35,830
Mr. Hui,

151
00:08:35,830 --> 00:08:37,040
there are a lot of reporters outside

152
00:08:37,040 --> 00:08:38,830
asking about Feros Group.

153
00:08:39,040 --> 00:08:40,630
Are they from the three major TV stations?

154
00:08:40,630 --> 00:08:41,190
Yes.

155
00:08:41,310 --> 00:08:41,830
Good.

156
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,870
I want everyone to know

157
00:08:44,550 --> 00:08:46,040
that nothing can stand in my way.

158
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:55,760
Chairman Hui!

159
00:08:56,870 --> 00:08:57,680
Mr. Hui,

160
00:08:57,830 --> 00:08:59,480
there's a rumour that Tin Ping Group

161
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,720
is about to acquire Feros Group.

162
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:02,120
Is that true?

163
00:09:04,870 --> 00:09:05,680
It's ready.

164
00:09:09,630 --> 00:09:10,910
I baked this pineapple bun myself.

165
00:09:10,910 --> 00:09:12,950
It took me quite a few tries to recreate the old taste.

166
00:09:14,830 --> 00:09:15,910
Try it and see if it's the same.

167
00:09:16,830 --> 00:09:17,830
Thanks.

168
00:09:17,830 --> 00:09:18,910
I can manage myself.

169
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,040
Here.

170
00:09:26,230 --> 00:09:28,440
I said I can do it myself. You don't have to fuss over me.

171
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:33,760
You look much better.

172
00:09:34,270 --> 00:09:35,800
Once we've eaten,

173
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:38,230
we can think of something to do today.

174
00:09:38,510 --> 00:09:39,760
Do you want to watch a film?

175
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:42,230
I'm trapped here with you anyway.

176
00:09:42,910 --> 00:09:44,230
Do whatever you want.

177
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,230
Foon Gor,

178
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:46,680
don't be like that.

179
00:09:46,870 --> 00:09:48,080
If there's anything you want to do,

180
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:50,040
just tell me.

181
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:51,480
Boss.

182
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:52,680
What is it?

183
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,910
Something's come up involving the company. Please take a look.

184
00:10:02,830 --> 00:10:04,680
There's a rumour that Tin Ping Group is about to acquire

185
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:05,680
Feros Group.

186
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:07,080
Is that true?

187
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:09,680
This is purely a business decision.

188
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:12,270
We believe Feros has enormous growth potential,

189
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:14,440
and there is significant overlap between our businesses.

190
00:10:14,830 --> 00:10:16,080
Rather than waste resources competing with each other,

191
00:10:16,160 --> 00:10:18,720
we'd be better off combining our resources for growth.

192
00:10:19,310 --> 00:10:21,680
I look forward to meeting Siu Yan, the chairman of Feros,

193
00:10:21,950 --> 00:10:23,720
to discuss further cooperation.

194
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,310
Thank you.

195
00:10:25,510 --> 00:10:26,680
Hui Loek To...

196
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:29,310
So this is how he's forcing me out.

197
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:31,950
Our entire raw material supply chain has been cut off.

198
00:10:32,270 --> 00:10:34,080
It's seriously delaying our deliveries.

199
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:36,270
This isn't something we can solve in the short term.

200
00:10:37,270 --> 00:10:39,230
Get everything ready so we can return to the UK.

201
00:10:39,870 --> 00:10:41,000
Everything else

202
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,680
can wait until we're back in the UK.

203
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,190
We'll make new arrangements there.

204
00:10:44,190 --> 00:10:45,000
Understood, boss.

205
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:50,160
Hui Loek To

206
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:51,550
has caused so much trouble

207
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:55,270
and just won't leave you alone.

208
00:10:57,630 --> 00:10:58,680
But it's okay.

209
00:10:59,830 --> 00:11:01,630
I won't let him get in our way again.

210
00:11:01,910 --> 00:11:02,720
Tomorrow,

211
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:05,160
we're leaving for the UK.

212
00:11:05,830 --> 00:11:07,230
And we're never coming back.

213
00:11:07,910 --> 00:11:09,360
I'm not going with you.

214
00:11:09,830 --> 00:11:11,120
What is so good about him?

215
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,830
Why won't you leave him?

216
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:16,870
Because I believe that no matter what happens,

217
00:11:16,910 --> 00:11:18,440
he'll come back for me.

218
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,270
So did I.

219
00:11:19,950 --> 00:11:22,120
I came all the way from the UK to find you.

220
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,870
I'm the one who's willing

221
00:11:23,870 --> 00:11:26,230
to give you everything without asking for anything back.

222
00:11:28,630 --> 00:11:29,510
For you,

223
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:31,160
I'd do anything.

224
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,630
For me,

225
00:11:33,310 --> 00:11:34,630
you'd really do anything?

226
00:11:34,910 --> 00:11:35,480
Yes.

227
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,830
I'd do anything for you.

228
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,230
Then turn yourself in.

229
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:42,160
Take responsibility for everything you've done.

230
00:11:43,270 --> 00:11:44,720
If you can really do that,

231
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:47,590
I'll admit you're someone who can face the consequences.

232
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:55,510
So you never intended to be with me at all.

233
00:11:56,550 --> 00:11:57,440
But it's okay.

234
00:11:57,800 --> 00:11:59,120
Once we leave here,

235
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,950
everything will be different.

236
00:12:01,590 --> 00:12:04,550
Whether it takes one year or two,

237
00:12:05,310 --> 00:12:06,680
however many years it takes,

238
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:09,360
I'll wait for you to change your mind.

239
00:12:22,270 --> 00:12:23,480
Any new leads?

240
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:28,480
We reconstructed their route based on the CCTV footage.

241
00:12:29,510 --> 00:12:31,120
Mr. Mok is most likely here.

242
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:32,680
Then what are we waiting for?

243
00:12:32,910 --> 00:12:35,120
There's only one road in and out of the mountain,

244
00:12:35,270 --> 00:12:37,000
with no shortcuts or side paths.

245
00:12:37,910 --> 00:12:41,480
There are at least dozens of guards between the perimeter and the gate,

246
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:43,080
armed with both handguns and long guns.

247
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:45,000
A direct assault would be extremely difficult.

248
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:47,870
If we can confirm Mr. Mok's exact location first,

249
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:50,590
we'll have a much better chance of getting him out safely.

250
00:12:54,680 --> 00:12:56,440
I have a way to find him.

251
00:12:58,230 --> 00:12:59,550
Out of my way!

252
00:12:59,680 --> 00:13:00,310
Move!

253
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:01,760
Stop it, Mum.

254
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:03,310
You brat.

255
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:06,000
When you got engaged to Ms. So,

256
00:13:06,510 --> 00:13:08,360
I thought you'd finally grown up for the sake of the family.

257
00:13:08,870 --> 00:13:10,310
But then you kept disappearing,

258
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:12,910
not showing up at Tin Ping or Sheng Tung.

259
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:15,000
I turned a blind eye,

260
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:17,120
thinking you'd come back and take charge once you'd sorted yourself out.

261
00:13:17,400 --> 00:13:20,190
But now that Eastern Hall is ripe for the taking, you're not even making a move?

262
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:21,950
I can let all that slide.

263
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:25,190
But now you're doing something completely pointless?

264
00:13:26,590 --> 00:13:27,510
Pointless?

265
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:28,910
What exactly is so pointless about it?

266
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,160
Don't act like you don't understand.

267
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:33,760
Everyone knows Tin Ping's financial situation.

268
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:36,270
The cash flow for the Bayfront Metropolis development

269
00:13:36,270 --> 00:13:37,480
is already stretched to the limit,

270
00:13:37,680 --> 00:13:40,120
and you're still spending money to acquire Feros

271
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:44,000
and sending Sheng Tung's men out to fight everywhere,

272
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:46,310
all for one cop?

273
00:13:47,270 --> 00:13:48,000
Hui Loek To,

274
00:13:48,270 --> 00:13:49,510
you've lost your mind!

275
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:59,510
Don't think everything can always go your way.

276
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:03,270
I don't want to see you destroy your father's life's work.

277
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:07,950
The uncles have always wanted Luk King to replace you.

278
00:14:08,590 --> 00:14:10,870
Do you know how hard I've fought to keep you in charge?

279
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:12,590
Do you?

280
00:14:24,760 --> 00:14:25,550
Mum.

281
00:14:29,910 --> 00:14:31,400
It's been a long time since I called you that.

282
00:14:34,550 --> 00:14:37,000
I know you've always loved Luk King and me,

283
00:14:41,310 --> 00:14:43,000
and that's why you've been so hard on us.

284
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:46,120
But I'm an adult now.

285
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:50,720
The man I love is waiting for me.

286
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:54,080
I have to do everything I can to save him.

287
00:14:55,510 --> 00:14:58,270
If it were you or Luk King,

288
00:14:58,910 --> 00:15:01,080
I'd do everything I could to save you too,

289
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:05,360
because you're both among the most important people in my life.

290
00:15:12,870 --> 00:15:13,870
I'm sorry.

291
00:15:14,510 --> 00:15:17,000
I just don't want you to end up

292
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:17,950
the way your father did.

293
00:15:22,910 --> 00:15:23,720
I understand.

294
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:25,910
Don't worry.

295
00:15:26,550 --> 00:15:28,120
I'll take care of myself.

296
00:15:30,590 --> 00:15:31,510
Luk King.

297
00:15:35,870 --> 00:15:37,000
Take good care of Mum.

298
00:15:39,230 --> 00:15:40,000
Loek To,

299
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:41,720
whatever happens, be careful.

300
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:38,400
Siu Yan!

301
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:39,550
What are you doing?

302
00:16:39,550 --> 00:16:40,760
Let me out!

303
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,120
Siu Yan,

304
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:43,870
let me out!

305
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:46,870
Siu Yan,

306
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:49,190
listen to me.

307
00:16:49,910 --> 00:16:51,950
I'm not going to the UK with you.

308
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:54,480
Let me out of here now!

309
00:16:55,310 --> 00:16:56,120
Siu Yan!

310
00:17:41,550 --> 00:17:48,480
[FEI FOON]

311
00:18:09,950 --> 00:18:15,510
[HERE]

312
00:18:24,950 --> 00:18:29,870
[U OK?]

313
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:42,550
[NO UK SOON]

314
00:18:43,620 --> 00:18:46,300
♪Amor bajo un muro al borde del derrumbe♪

315
00:18:47,510 --> 00:18:55,120
[I WILL COME SAVE U]

316
00:18:58,680 --> 00:19:10,080
[NO. CALL COPS]

317
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:12,580
♪Decido amarte a ciegas♪

318
00:19:13,320 --> 00:19:15,780
♪Supongo que merezco morir por esto♪

319
00:19:18,040 --> 00:19:21,830
[OK]

320
00:19:24,190 --> 00:19:35,000
[STAY AWAY]

321
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:39,800
♪Solo con autoengaño creo que puedo ganar el amor♪

322
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:43,230
[OK]

323
00:19:43,230 --> 00:19:49,000
[AFTERWARD]

324
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:56,870
[U ME HOME]

325
00:19:58,100 --> 00:20:00,660
♪Si es un amor equivocado♪

326
00:20:01,830 --> 00:20:09,360
[I LOVE YOU]

327
00:20:14,590 --> 00:20:22,590
[ME 2]

328
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:49,080
What is it,

329
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:49,800
Foon Gor?

330
00:20:51,630 --> 00:20:52,760
Are you afraid of me?

331
00:20:54,950 --> 00:20:55,910
Why?

332
00:20:57,190 --> 00:20:59,230
Why do you smile and cry whenever you

333
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:00,510
see that man?

334
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:04,230
Why do you always look so blank when you see me?

335
00:21:07,190 --> 00:21:08,550
Do you hate me that much?

336
00:21:08,630 --> 00:21:10,080
I've never hated you.

337
00:21:10,590 --> 00:21:11,950
Shawn, snap out of it.

338
00:21:12,360 --> 00:21:14,160
You can't force someone to love you.

339
00:21:15,190 --> 00:21:16,000
Why?

340
00:21:16,910 --> 00:21:18,510
I've done so much for you.

341
00:21:19,550 --> 00:21:21,360
What does he have that I don't?

342
00:21:21,590 --> 00:21:23,040
Or do you just need a man

343
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:24,870
who wants to sleep with you?

344
00:21:24,870 --> 00:21:25,550
Watch your mouth!

345
00:21:26,910 --> 00:21:28,590
Is that why you're rejecting me?

346
00:21:31,310 --> 00:21:32,190
Shawn,

347
00:21:32,480 --> 00:21:34,000
I've made myself perfectly clear...

348
00:21:35,230 --> 00:21:36,440
Have you lost your mind?

349
00:21:38,040 --> 00:21:39,310
You want a man, don't you?

350
00:21:40,120 --> 00:21:41,190
I can be that man too.

351
00:21:41,830 --> 00:21:43,000
Whatever he can do,

352
00:21:43,310 --> 00:21:44,550
I can do it too.

353
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:47,230
Enough!

354
00:21:51,590 --> 00:21:52,910
Even if Hui Loek To didn't exist,

355
00:21:53,160 --> 00:21:54,800
I would never be with you.

356
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:57,910
I've only ever seen you as a younger brother.

357
00:21:58,040 --> 00:21:59,630
I've never loved you that way. Do you understand?

358
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:01,590
That's enough for me,

359
00:22:01,760 --> 00:22:03,360
even if you only see me as a younger brother.

360
00:22:04,310 --> 00:22:08,310
But now I don't even have a place in your heart.

361
00:22:08,830 --> 00:22:10,720
Everything you do,

362
00:22:11,550 --> 00:22:12,550
everything,

363
00:22:13,120 --> 00:22:14,760
is pushing me away.

364
00:22:15,080 --> 00:22:16,120
For more than ten years,

365
00:22:16,440 --> 00:22:18,550
you've been the reason I've kept going.

366
00:22:20,910 --> 00:22:21,720
Shawn,

367
00:22:22,550 --> 00:22:23,830
snap out of it.

368
00:22:28,310 --> 00:22:30,720
I'll never let you leave me again.

369
00:22:31,270 --> 00:22:34,000
No matter what, I won't.

370
00:22:36,310 --> 00:22:37,550
Then shoot me!

371
00:23:11,910 --> 00:23:12,680
What's the situation?

372
00:23:12,870 --> 00:23:13,910
When we arrived,

373
00:23:14,270 --> 00:23:15,720
the whole house was already empty.

374
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:16,550
What about Fei Foon?

375
00:23:17,270 --> 00:23:18,400
I'm sorry, boss.

376
00:23:18,510 --> 00:23:20,120
We found Mr. Mok on the second floor,

377
00:23:20,190 --> 00:23:21,310
but he was already...

378
00:23:56,510 --> 00:23:57,310
Fei Foon?

379
00:24:11,950 --> 00:24:12,760
Fei Foon...

380
00:24:21,080 --> 00:24:21,870
Fei Foon,

381
00:24:22,360 --> 00:24:25,400
answer me.

382
00:24:35,230 --> 00:24:36,480
How did this happen?

383
00:24:42,510 --> 00:24:43,270
Fei Foon,

384
00:24:43,760 --> 00:24:46,800
please answer me.

385
00:24:51,680 --> 00:24:53,440
Don't go.

386
00:24:57,310 --> 00:24:58,910
I was wrong.

387
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:02,120
I shouldn't have treated you like a bargaining chip.

388
00:25:06,400 --> 00:25:08,760
I know I was wrong. I really do.

389
00:25:08,760 --> 00:25:10,120
Please wake up, okay?

390
00:25:11,870 --> 00:25:14,310
Don't leave me all alone, okay?

391
00:25:17,360 --> 00:25:19,270
We still have to go see the glaciers together.

392
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:23,870
Didn't you say you wanted to watch films together?

393
00:25:24,190 --> 00:25:25,360
Let's go watch a film.

394
00:25:27,950 --> 00:25:29,680
Don't leave me.

395
00:25:50,910 --> 00:25:52,590
What a touching confession of love.

396
00:25:53,480 --> 00:25:55,270
Seeing Hui Loek To so heartbroken,

397
00:25:55,760 --> 00:25:57,910
I almost cried with him.

398
00:25:58,270 --> 00:25:59,510
What a pity

399
00:26:00,510 --> 00:26:03,270
we can't witness such a tragically beautiful scene in person.

400
00:26:04,000 --> 00:26:05,480
Want to watch it again?

401
00:26:09,120 --> 00:26:12,760
Mok Fei Foon is already back by Hui Loek To's side.

402
00:26:13,680 --> 00:26:15,800
What should I call you from now on?

403
00:26:16,550 --> 00:26:18,270
Call me whatever you want.

404
00:26:19,230 --> 00:26:20,910
But no matter what you call me,

405
00:26:21,760 --> 00:26:23,120
I'll always be myself.

406
00:26:23,800 --> 00:26:25,080
That will never change.

407
00:26:27,190 --> 00:26:28,040
Is that so?

408
00:26:30,160 --> 00:26:31,910
The man who claims to love you so much

409
00:26:32,400 --> 00:26:33,950
can't even tell the real you from a fake.

410
00:26:40,950 --> 00:26:42,120
Just imagine.

411
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:43,910
He cried and begged for forgiveness,

412
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:46,480
held that body tightly,

413
00:26:46,590 --> 00:26:48,720
ran his hands all over him,

414
00:26:49,510 --> 00:26:51,510
and never even realised it wasn't you.

415
00:26:52,310 --> 00:26:53,910
He doesn't know you at all.

416
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:56,550
If that man was Hui Loek To,

417
00:26:57,360 --> 00:26:59,760
he'd know it wasn't me.

418
00:27:00,080 --> 00:27:01,120
He'd know.

419
00:27:01,680 --> 00:27:03,480
Whether he knows or not,

420
00:27:03,950 --> 00:27:05,590
we're leaving this place

421
00:27:05,590 --> 00:27:07,000
and starting a new life.

422
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:08,910
Most importantly,

423
00:27:09,590 --> 00:27:10,910
I'll show you

424
00:27:11,270 --> 00:27:14,550
that I love and respect you more than Hui Loek To does.

425
00:27:15,270 --> 00:27:17,230
I'll never let you suffer.

426
00:27:17,230 --> 00:27:18,120
We'll live openly and honestly...

427
00:27:18,120 --> 00:27:18,950
Openly and honestly?

428
00:27:19,720 --> 00:27:22,120
How can I do that when I'm leaving

429
00:27:24,120 --> 00:27:25,680
with a wanted criminal?

430
00:27:27,870 --> 00:27:31,680
Is this your idea of love and respect?

431
00:27:32,680 --> 00:27:33,800
Just say yes.

432
00:27:33,800 --> 00:27:34,910
All this will only be temporary.

433
00:27:34,910 --> 00:27:35,720
Shawn.

434
00:27:37,160 --> 00:27:38,680
Do whatever you want.

435
00:27:41,120 --> 00:27:43,000
As long as I'm by your side,

436
00:27:43,720 --> 00:27:46,800
I'll do everything I can to stop you.

437
00:27:47,720 --> 00:27:49,510
You can take me away,

438
00:27:50,910 --> 00:27:55,120
but you'll never have another peaceful night's sleep.

439
00:27:56,120 --> 00:27:57,550
Do you really hate me that much?

440
00:27:59,910 --> 00:28:00,720
Why?

441
00:28:01,480 --> 00:28:03,360
I've done so much for you.

442
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:06,590
So much...

443
00:28:10,400 --> 00:28:11,680
Shoot me.

444
00:28:14,910 --> 00:28:16,270
You're not doing this for me.

445
00:28:18,080 --> 00:28:20,360
You're doing it for the person in your imagination.

446
00:28:20,510 --> 00:28:22,190
And that person no longer exists.

447
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:24,870
I love you.

448
00:28:25,160 --> 00:28:26,360
I love the person you were,

449
00:28:27,120 --> 00:28:28,190
and the person you are now.

450
00:28:28,950 --> 00:28:30,400
I love every version of you.

451
00:28:31,720 --> 00:28:34,120
Why won't you ever give me a chance?

452
00:28:35,680 --> 00:28:37,190
Because the man I love

453
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:39,000
is Hui Loek To.

454
00:28:43,310 --> 00:28:44,720
He doesn't love you!

455
00:28:44,720 --> 00:28:45,800
But I love him!

456
00:28:48,510 --> 00:28:50,870
From the moment we met,

457
00:28:52,270 --> 00:28:54,400
my feelings for him have never changed.

458
00:28:55,480 --> 00:28:56,510
Not once.

459
00:28:58,360 --> 00:29:00,190
And they won't until the day I die.

460
00:29:55,190 --> 00:29:57,860
Boss, we've found something at the marina.

461
00:29:58,140 --> 00:29:59,100
I'm on my way.

462
00:30:02,870 --> 00:30:03,590
What's the situation?

463
00:30:03,590 --> 00:30:05,830
We found a yacht belonging to Siu Yan docked here.

464
00:30:23,120 --> 00:30:24,160
- Split up and search.
- Split up and search.

465
00:30:39,760 --> 00:30:40,800
Where's Fei Foon?

466
00:30:49,910 --> 00:30:51,120
Where is he?

467
00:30:52,590 --> 00:30:53,480
Feros.

468
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:55,400
Dreamweaver.

469
00:30:56,360 --> 00:30:58,120
They're both doomed because of you.

470
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:00,800
Congratulations.

471
00:31:01,760 --> 00:31:03,680
I'm asking you. Where is Fei Foon?

472
00:31:04,190 --> 00:31:05,590
Tell me something first.

473
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:07,080
I'm curious.

474
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:09,870
How did you know that wasn't Fei Foon?

475
00:31:10,120 --> 00:31:12,080
What Fei Foon and I share

476
00:31:12,440 --> 00:31:13,870
is something you'll never understand.

477
00:31:14,910 --> 00:31:16,270
I'm in no hurry.

478
00:31:17,270 --> 00:31:18,680
Take your time and tell me.

479
00:31:24,510 --> 00:31:26,400
Where is Fei Foon?

480
00:31:28,310 --> 00:31:29,120
Hui Loek To,

481
00:31:30,080 --> 00:31:31,480
Fei Foon really does love you.

482
00:31:32,040 --> 00:31:33,080
Do you know that?

483
00:31:33,270 --> 00:31:34,160
Enough.

484
00:31:34,950 --> 00:31:36,360
Where is Fei Foon?

485
00:31:37,480 --> 00:31:38,720
How about I tell you

486
00:31:38,870 --> 00:31:41,310
what Fei Foon looked like

487
00:31:41,800 --> 00:31:43,120
when I held a gun to his head?

488
00:31:47,720 --> 00:31:48,870
You killed him?

489
00:31:50,080 --> 00:31:50,870
What's wrong?

490
00:31:51,910 --> 00:31:53,590
You want to know where he is?

491
00:31:53,680 --> 00:31:54,590
Get on your knees

492
00:31:55,040 --> 00:31:56,720
and shoot yourself.

493
00:31:57,190 --> 00:31:58,720
Before you take your last breath,

494
00:31:59,270 --> 00:32:00,870
I might decide to tell you.

495
00:32:06,910 --> 00:32:10,800
I just want to know if Fei Foon is safe.

496
00:32:10,800 --> 00:32:11,800
What?

497
00:32:12,510 --> 00:32:14,800
Even if you knew, what could you do about it?

498
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:17,400
Do you really think you can get back together with him?

499
00:32:18,310 --> 00:32:20,120
I've made far too many mistakes.

500
00:32:22,000 --> 00:32:23,950
I never knew how to respect him,

501
00:32:25,160 --> 00:32:26,910
and I put him through so much humiliation

502
00:32:28,080 --> 00:32:29,040
and pain.

503
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:33,590
Of course I want him back by my side.

504
00:32:35,270 --> 00:32:36,590
But if he wants to leave,

505
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:38,630
I won't force him to stay.

506
00:32:40,720 --> 00:32:41,910
I just want him

507
00:32:42,830 --> 00:32:44,080
to be safe.

508
00:32:45,480 --> 00:32:46,400
Shawn,

509
00:32:47,830 --> 00:32:49,480
you love him very much, don't you?

510
00:32:50,550 --> 00:32:52,360
I know you wouldn't hurt him.

511
00:32:55,360 --> 00:32:58,270
If you really intend to keep him by your side,

512
00:32:59,910 --> 00:33:00,950
promise me one thing.

513
00:33:02,720 --> 00:33:03,760
Treat him well.

514
00:33:04,480 --> 00:33:07,190
Don't make him suffer anymore, okay?

515
00:33:07,720 --> 00:33:09,180
Stop lying.

516
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:10,760
You'd never let him go.

517
00:33:24,910 --> 00:33:25,800
Promise me.

518
00:33:26,910 --> 00:33:27,720
Take good care of Fei Foon.

519
00:33:39,120 --> 00:33:40,190
You're so lucky.

520
00:33:41,630 --> 00:33:42,800
Do you think you've won?

521
00:33:44,480 --> 00:33:47,480
I'll always be the one who loves Fei Foon the most.

522
00:33:54,310 --> 00:33:55,120
Shawn!

523
00:34:00,510 --> 00:34:01,310
Shawn!

524
00:34:07,510 --> 00:34:08,000
Shawn?

525
00:34:08,040 --> 00:34:08,830
It really is you.

526
00:34:09,950 --> 00:34:11,480
I knew you wouldn't forget me.

527
00:34:12,590 --> 00:34:14,000
Your birthday is coming up.

528
00:34:14,630 --> 00:34:17,360
I booked a set menu at a three-Michelin-star restaurant.

529
00:34:17,630 --> 00:34:18,950
I want to take you there.

530
00:34:18,950 --> 00:34:20,630
I've thought it through.

531
00:34:20,950 --> 00:34:23,760
Why don't we go out today?

532
00:34:24,120 --> 00:34:26,000
I'd like to get to know you better.

533
00:34:36,830 --> 00:34:38,830
You're so sweet, Foon Gor.

534
00:34:46,360 --> 00:34:47,120
Go.

535
00:34:51,630 --> 00:34:53,120
I said go!

536
00:35:11,230 --> 00:35:13,120
I'll do what I have to do,

537
00:35:13,910 --> 00:35:17,080
but I'll give you time to turn yourself in.

538
00:35:23,230 --> 00:35:24,160
Goodbye,

539
00:35:24,870 --> 00:35:25,760
Fei Foon.

540
00:35:29,680 --> 00:35:30,480
Boss!

541
00:35:33,080 --> 00:35:33,870
Are you okay?

542
00:35:35,680 --> 00:35:36,440
I'm fine.

543
00:35:36,550 --> 00:35:39,630
We searched the entire yacht, but we couldn't find anyone.

544
00:35:50,310 --> 00:35:50,910
Breaking news.

545
00:35:50,910 --> 00:35:53,000
Acting on intelligence provided by an undercover officer,

546
00:35:53,000 --> 00:35:56,040
police have cracked a major transnational counterfeit money case.

547
00:35:56,040 --> 00:35:56,830
So far,

548
00:35:56,830 --> 00:35:58,910
several suspects have been arrested

549
00:35:58,910 --> 00:36:00,680
and are now being questioned.

550
00:36:25,760 --> 00:36:26,550
Hey!

551
00:36:43,120 --> 00:36:44,360
Can you stop being a police officer?

552
00:36:49,910 --> 00:36:51,590
If I quit, are you going to support me?

553
00:36:58,080 --> 00:36:59,120
I'll support you!

554
00:37:09,370 --> 00:37:13,020
♪Who still longs for a love they know can never be?♪

555
00:37:15,990 --> 00:37:20,480
♪Who was torn apart by the boundaries of this world?♪

556
00:37:22,790 --> 00:37:26,780
♪Who, at death's door, whispers only one name?♪

557
